


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_35a37341:



    voice "2SA_1033"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_f614085f:


    "祥子正把画布收进瓦楞箱里。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_d05f6b97:


    "她拿起画着乃绘瑠的那幅，目不转睛地看着。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_731a1be3:



    voice "2SA_1034"
    sachiko "「我没有忘记你」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_ca5559d9:



    voice "2SA_1035"
    sachiko "「但是……这真的是关于乃绘瑠的记忆吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_2d8442da:



    voice "2SA_1036"
    sachiko "「我在这张画里看到的，是乃绘瑠的影子，还是……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_653d7704:


    "祥子就像是逃避肖像里的视线般把画布塞进了箱子。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_434de965:



    voice "2HI_1620"
    hina "「祥子姐，你在吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_a77ae2d6:



    voice "2SA_1037"
    sachiko "「在的，进来吧～」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_61546820:


    "回到宿舍的四人往房间里投来视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_b623fa13:



    voice "2HI_1621"
    hina "「给你的快递」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_2163a155:



    voice "2SA_1038"
    sachiko "「谢了。放桌上吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_84100eb4:



    voice "2FU_1307"
    fumi "「在收拾房间？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_86b2f2f0:


    "文看到瓦楞箱后如此问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_4efc7c77:



    voice "2SA_1039"
    sachiko "「嗯，稍微收拾一下」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_7d47f380:



    voice "2RI_1716"
    rin "「房间里的东西这么少还需要收拾吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_436104c4:


    "确实。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_ed870f1c:



    voice "2SA_1040"
    sachiko "「是啊。正好，你们要衣服吗？是四五年前买的，但应该没有太大破损」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_7c0b716a:



    voice "2FU_1308"
    fumi "「要看要看～♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_f32801ac:


    "文立刻就开始物色起衣架上的衣服。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_dc4d4285:



    voice "2FU_1309"
    fumi "「啊咧？很多衣服都不像是祥子姐会穿的那种啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_ba82df96:



    voice "2SA_1041"
    sachiko "「是啊。算是尝试失败后留下的东西？全都不适合我穿。那边的衣服基本都没穿过」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_f1ed3352:



    voice "2FU_1310"
    fumi "「这样啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_0a6d6673:



    voice "2RI_1717"
    rin "「诶，东西都挺不错的嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_536c0c47:



    voice "2SA_1042"
    sachiko "「不愧是大小姐，眼光挺高」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_0a3ea1ad:



    voice "2MI_1153"
    miyako "「伦是大小姐吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_a34b0b3e:



    voice "2SA_1043"
    sachiko "「啊，这家伙时不时会穿名牌服装哦？因为家里有钱」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_63a202c5:



    voice "2RI_1718"
    rin "「家里有钱又不是我的错」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_2453a07f:



    voice "2MI_1154"
    miyako "「但为何突然送衣服？再继续减少行李的话……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_ebeb49f8:



    voice "2SA_1044"
    sachiko "「就会轻松一些吧？看看能不能用一个大包装下所有东西吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_eecfba26:



    voice "2MI_1155"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_8dd61e59:



    voice "2FU_1311"
    fumi "「哈呜呜呜……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_4bd66684:


    "悲叹声。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_42b41a55:



    voice "2MI_1156"
    miyako "「怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_26a67689:



    voice "2FU_1312"
    fumi "「胸围太紧了穿不了～」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_f7c4bb4c:



    voice "2MI_1157"
    miyako "「啊啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_9e482bdf:



    voice "2HI_1622"
    hina "「……太大了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_74fd1cae:



    voice "2RI_1719"
    rin "「那我穿大概会太短吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_18e4eec8:


    "就像是金凤花姑娘和三只熊啊。虽然没有小熊。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_abbfbfcb:



    voice "2SA_1045"
    sachiko "「这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_db3e155c:



    voice "2FU_1313"
    fumi "「很遗憾……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_9ffc911d:



    voice "2RI_1720"
    rin "「啊，圣夜夜穿的话应该刚刚好？就是胸部会紧一点」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_d67a0c55:



    voice "2MI_1158"
    miyako "「是啊～」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_05706bea:


    "圣夜子拿起衬衫和自己的身体比对。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_89ee9a16:



    voice "2RI_1721"
    rin "「啊咧？正正好诶」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_ca71e947:


    "有小熊啦。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_167c83ec:



    voice "2FU_1314"
    fumi "「这件很适合你呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_0626822b:



    voice "2HI_1623"
    hina "「就像是专门买给圣夜子的」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_6d2ec706:


    "……嘛，差不多就是这样。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_70dd62b4:



    voice "2SA_1046"
    sachiko "「给你了。至少能帮你加几套穿搭吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_5e90e768:



    voice "2MI_1159"
    miyako "「可以吗？前些时候才刚送了我围巾的」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_63ded442:



    voice "2SA_1047"
    sachiko "「没关系，拿去吧。衣服和围巾也希望找到合身的主人啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_08_41ae92aa:



    voice "2MI_1160"
    miyako "「……谢谢」"
